action-not-first	error	a step statement appears above the step's action block
bad-arity	error	a call or a browser action has the wrong number of arguments
bad-override	error	a line in a use block is not an argument or an override that applies
bad-row-name	error	a data-driven scenario's name reads something other than its row
bad-tag	error	a tag is not a lower-case word written out as a string, or is listed twice
bad-value	error	a value is the wrong kind for the position it is in
body-conflict	error	a request says what its body is more than one way
data-file-missing	error	json(), csv() or file() names a path where there is no file
data-not-csv	error	csv() names a file that is not CSV
data-not-json	error	json() names a file that is not JSON
db-args-without-sql	error	a db step binds args with no sql to bind them to
db-needs-statement	error	a db step has no sql or command to run
db-statement-conflict	error	a db step has both sql and a command
db-statement-kind	error	a db step sends sql to a database that takes a command, or the other way round
drop-after-expect	error	a drop expects line comes after an expect line in the same use block
duplicate-action	error	a step block contains more than one action block
duplicate-argument	error	a use passes the same argument twice
duplicate-binding	error	a capture or var reuses a name a var or an earlier capture binds
duplicate-import-name	error	two imports give their collections the same name
duplicate-phase	error	a scenario has two setup blocks or two teardown blocks
duplicate-row-name	error	two rows of a data-driven scenario name it alike
duplicate-suite-name	error	a suite exports a name a suite above it already exports
duplicate-tags	error	a scenario or a suite has more than one tags list
for-no-rows	error	a for clause's data has no rows
for-source-not-array	error	a for clause's data is not an array of rows
for-source-not-static	error	a for clause reads rows that are not known before the run
import-cycle	error	a file imports itself, directly or through other files
import-needs-file	error	a file read from no disk imports another file
import-needs-name	error	an import has no "as" and its file's name cannot be what a use names it by
import-no-collection	error	an imported file holds no collection
import-not-found	error	an imported file cannot be read
import-placement	error	an import appears below a collection or a scenario
invalid-duration	error	a string in a duration position is not a duration
invalid-escape	error	a string literal contains an escape the language does not define
invalid-regex	error	a regex literal does not compile
missing-action	error	a step block contains no action block, so the step has no type
missing-argument	error	a use does not pass a parameter that has no default
missing-separator	error	two statements run together with no newline or comma between them
nesting-too-deep	error	a file nests deeper than the parser will descend
non-associative-operator	error	a comparison operator is chained with another
not-in-scope	error	a name is not bound in this step's type
reserved-param	error	a parameter is named like a use-block override word, so no use can pass it
reserved-word	error	a word reserved for a later tier is used as a name
root-capture	error	a collection's template captures under the name of a step's observation, such as body
scenario-in-collection-file	error	a file holding a collection also holds a scenario
second-collection	error	a file holds more than one collection
secret-argument	error	an argument to a secret parameter is not itself secret
setup-after-step	error	a setup block is below a step it would run before
suite-file-name	error	a suite block is in a file not named suite.art
suite-has-scenario	error	a suite file holds a scenario, or a second suite block
suite-has-step	error	a suite block holds a step or a use outside setup and teardown
teardown-before-step	error	a teardown block is above a step it would run after
unclosed-block	error	a "{", "(" or "[" is never closed
unclosed-interpolation	error	a "${" in a string has no closing "}"
unclosed-interpolation-expr	error	a "${" expression is followed by neither "}" nor more string
unexpected-character	error	a byte in the source starts no token
unexpected-token	error	a token appears where the grammar wanted another
unknown-argument	error	a use passes an argument the item has no parameter for
unknown-collection	error	a use names a collection that is not in scope
unknown-config	error	a "config" names a subject the language does not configure
unknown-db-scheme	error	a db step's connection URL names a database artemis has no driver for
unknown-field	error	an identifier names no field of anything in scope
unknown-identifier	error	a name is bound nowhere in the file
unknown-item	error	a use names a request its collection does not declare
unknown-type	error	the right-hand side of "is" is not a type name
unterminated-regex	error	a regex literal has no closing slash
unterminated-string	error	a string literal has no closing quote
